## Conclusion

Gitlytics successfully delivers an intuitive analytical experience that transforms raw repository catalogs into structured developer intelligence. Developed to satisfy university laboratory and project evaluation criteria, it stands as a robust foundation for future full-stack developer portfolio platforms.
